@@ -3,6 +3,8 @@
 Version 8.2.0
 -------------
 
+-   Add a ``timeout`` option to ``click.edit`` with editor-process cleanup.
+
 Unreleased
 
 -   Drop support for Python 3.7. :pr:`2588`
diff --git a/docs/utils.rst b/docs/utils.rst
index 995c171..be3b30d 100644
--- a/docs/utils.rst
+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,10 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Pass a positive integer ``timeout`` to bound an editor session.  A timed-out
+editor and its child processes are stopped and :exc:`ClickException` is
+raised.  The default ``None`` continues to wait without a limit.
+
 
 Launching Applications
 ----------------------
